---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout description="Key Camp helps young people use AI agents to turn their own ideas into working projects.">
  <section class="hero wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">AI fluency · creative problem-solving · grades 3–12</p>
    <h1>Build what<br /><em>matters to you.</em></h1>
    <p class="lede">Key Camp helps young people use AI agents to turn their own ideas into working projects—from art and construction to community stories, entrepreneurship, and software.</p>
    <div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href="/lessons/">Explore the lessons <span>↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="#why">Why Key Camp?</a></div>
  </section>

  <section class="signal wrap" aria-label="Key Camp approach">
    <div><span class="number">01</span><strong>Make the environment</strong><p>Set up a Raspberry Pi, secure access, and an agent that can actually do useful work.</p></div>
    <div><span class="number">02</span><strong>Bring your idea</strong><p>Your project can be a portfolio for art, a construction plan, a local story, or anything worth making.</p></div>
    <div><span class="number">03</span><strong>Learn from evidence</strong><p>Key Camp applies the scientific method to agentic engineering: build, test, share, and improve.</p></div>
  </section>

  <section id="why" class="statement wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">The point</p>
    <h2>Expand who gets to create with AI—not just who gets trained to code it.</h2>
    <p>Built with rural Indigenous communities and inner-city youth in mind, Key Camp makes powerful tools available to learners who are too often left out of the AI economy.</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .wrap { max-width: 1120px; margin: 0 auto; padding-left: 1.5rem; padding-right: 1.5rem; }
  .hero { padding-top: clamp(5rem, 13vw, 10rem); padding-bottom: 7rem; }
  .eyebrow, .number { color: var(--lime); font: 500 .72rem 'DM Mono', monospace; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  h1 { max-width: 850px; margin: 1.25rem 0; font-size: clamp(4rem, 12vw, 9.5rem); line-height: .88; letter-spacing: -.08em; }
  h1 em { color: var(--orange); font-style: normal; }
  .lede { max-width: 580px; color: var(--muted); font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2vw, 1.4rem); }
  .actions { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1.5rem; margin-top: 2.5rem; }
  .button { padding: .85rem 1.1rem; border: 1px solid var(--lime); border-radius: 999px; text-decoration: none; }
  .button.primary { background: var(--lime); color: #101311; }
  .button span { margin-left: .75rem; }
  .text-link { color: var(--muted); text-decoration-thickness: 1px; text-underline-offset: .3rem; }
  .signal { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1px; background: var(--line); border: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .signal > div { min-height: 220px; padding: 1.5rem; background: var(--panel); }
  .signal strong { display: block; margin-top: 3rem; font-size: 1.2rem; }
  .signal p, .statement p:last-child { color: var(--muted); }
  .statement { padding-top: 9rem; padding-bottom: 4rem; }
  h2 { max-width: 850px; margin: 1rem 0; font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 5rem); line-height: .98; letter-spacing: -.06em; }
  .statement p:last-child { max-width: 560px; font-size: 1.15rem; }
  @media (max-width: 700px) { .hero { padding-bottom: 4rem; } .signal { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .signal strong { margin-top: 2rem; } .actions { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; } }
</style>
